{"type":"message","message":{"id":"gen-1775330929-RSwshqKdX2UAc4Bem38h","role":"assistant","created":1775330939,"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me try another approach - searching for historical exchange rate data in more detail. The period 1949-1952 is particularly important because of the Bretton Woods system and the devaluation of sterling in 1949.\n\nAccording to historical records, the pound was devalued in 1949 from $4.03 to $2.80 per pound. This means the exchange rate was approximately:\n- 1949: ~$4.03 (before devaluation in September)\n- After September 1949: $2.80\n\nFor the years:\n- 1949: the average would be a blend of the old and new rates\n- 1950, 1951, 1952: $2.80 per pound\n\nThis is the USD/GBP rate. But I need GBP per USD, which would be the inverse.\n\n$2.80 per pound = 1/2.80 = 0.3571 pounds per dollar\n$4.03 per pound = 1/4.03 = 0.2481 pounds per dollar\n\nWait, this is wrong. The format is USD per GBP. I need GBP per USD.\n\nLet me think again:\n- If the rate is $2.80 per £1, that means £1 = $2.80\n- To get pounds per dollar: £1 / 2.80 = 0.3571 pounds per dollar\n\nActually wait - the question says \"annual average GBP per USD (pounds per $1)\". This means the exchange rate is expressed as how many pounds equal one dollar.\n\nSo:\n- 1949: after devaluation, $2.80 = £1, so £1 = $2.80, so $1 = £1/2.80 = £0.3571\n- 1950: $2.80 = £1, so £1 = $2.80, so $1 = £0.3571\n\n\n- 1951: $2.80 = £1, so £1 = $2.80, so $1 = £0.3571\n- 1952: $2.80 = £1, so £1 = $2.80, so $1 = £0.3571\n\nI realize I need precise annual average rates. I'll investigate official historical data sources to find the accurate yearly averages for 1949, 1950, and 1951.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_affdff7b5919486584f2f1dc","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"curl -sL \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_the_pound_sterling\" 2>/dev/null | grep -i \"1949\\|1950\\|1951\\|2.80\\|4.03\\|devaluation\" | head -30"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
